WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.277
Now it is time to apply the workflow independently.

00:00:03.277 --> 00:00:11.277
Start with a small table of at least eight rows, or load a small CSV file.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:16.257
Inspect the first rows, shape, data types, missing values, and duplicates.

00:00:16.257 --> 00:00:20.052
Next, clean at least one realistic issue.

00:00:20.052 --> 00:00:28.212
You might fix a data type, standardize a text category, handle a missing value, or remove a true duplicate.

00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:36.186
Then create at least one useful derived column and use groupby or a pivot table to answer a question.

00:00:36.727 --> 00:00:42.434
Finally, explain the result in plain language and identify one limitation.

00:00:42.434 --> 00:00:44.869
The explanation is important.

00:00:44.869 --> 00:00:51.599
Analytics is not complete until you can communicate what the code found and what the result does not prove.
